Original and pre-DI3 KPI template SHA256 both 0459b5834574108a8212e33696663e243661fb09eec39405f245e428437c1cd0. Pre-DI3 and final refresh JS SHA256 both e4f515e7adcd11c4bad42d5ec1207a37809203e19899c25591d9574cb3e5aca8; absent original. DI3 changes KPI focus targets from larger tiles to smaller detail controls and changes layout. The covering overlay is DI6. Therefore F1 is a run-introduced DI3–DI6 integration regression, observable after DI3, NOT pre-existing merely because the accepted DI3-era baseline also contains it. Earlier accepted checker results missed this cross-feature state; they do not clear F1.

